stream
BT /F2 22 Tf 72 720 Td (Before you go) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 680 Td (Book your bed at least two weeks ahead in July and August.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 660 Td (Bring a sleeping-bag liner: blankets are provided, sheets are not.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 640 Td (Most huts take cash only. Check the opening dates: high huts close in September.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 620 Td (Tell the warden if you will arrive after 18:00, or if you change your plans.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
