8 0 obj
<< /Length 435 >>
stream
BT /F2 22 Tf 72 720 Td (At the hut) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 680 Td (Leave boots, poles and ice axes in the boot room by the entrance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 660 Td (Dinner is served at 18:30, breakfast from 4:30 for early starts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 640 Td (Quiet hours run from 22:00 to 5:00. Lights out in the dormitories.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 620 Td (Water may not be drinkable: ask the warden before filling your bottle.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
