<< /Length 340 >>
stream
BT /F2 22 Tf 72 720 Td (Safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 680 Td (Check the weather forecast at the hut in the evening, and again at dawn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 660 Td (Write your route and expected return time in the hut book.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 640 Td (Emergency number in the Alps: 112. Helicopter rescue sign: both arms raised.) Tj ET
endstream
